B2 := barstate.isfirst and mk == "GC" ? "WASnX4W7UPWqSjXTVvURWFSRXgVgUPVXSRXRWPUDUlS4XaVoUQUpSJX5WGUU~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~WOWxUvVHVGVCUFUWUgVuUoUzVXSUX9W2URVdSAXYVwUVUpS2XhVVUaUoS3XHVpUWTWRdXlVmUWTxRuXVW4UW~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~WNWyV1VHVLV1UCUXUmVyUeUvVASLXMVwUXUnSFXSVlUdTbRaXiVxUKUXRfXzWFUESqRZXmVnUhSjRXXBVrUT~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~WMWwV4VAVHV4UJUcUmVxUgUnUbSEXJVmUdUZS9XUW6UTTHRYXwW5UNTeRWXkW0UQSARXXgVzUaSPRIXkVzUW~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~WMWzV1V7VPV2ULUaUhW2UhUpVzSxX6WMUSWRSaX6W7UVVbSIXNVuUNVVSLXPWPUGUmRoXYVeULUVSCXEVpUT~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~WNWzV9V6V6V9USUNUaViUsVPV6SJXSWCUOVNSTXBWQUWUMS7XLVoUVULRtXgWBUZTaRSXtW7U8SnRtX7VVUl~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~WLX0VCV4VJV1UMUVUbVoUpVDUMSGXXW8UZUfSBXTWZUQTeRfYDWaUETMRjXGVtUYSHQiXUVZU9SKRhYFWRUj~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~WMWyV9V5VGV5UMUSUjVlUuV6TmS1XfWVULUBRyXgWVUNT2RJYCWJUESwR8XqWGUERnQcXUVXUERmRxXkVlV9~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~WMWyVBV9V5V7UPUYUjVjUwV1VdSZX6WIUQVtSnWjWWUHV7SAX2W4U5VGRuXBVrUDUFRrXMVJUcUQRmXZW6UC~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~WMX1VOV6UbVJUXUsUsV8UoVJUWRxXBVrULV5RoXNWQTuTzRcXXW8UDU0RWXRW1U8TBROXoWGUCTQQwYSWWTs~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~WMX0VLV9UaVFUaUlUpVBUtVKTlRYXPVkUVU8RHXGW8U0T5REXnWFU5T9QfY0W6ToS3QuY3WFUASEQPYdWOTz~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~WMX3VGVAUaVDUgUqUvV6UrVGSlQvXkWAU3TRQtXtWaToSEQSYLWdTwRyQLXoW4U0RKQbYaWOU6QuPqZVWrTv~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~WKX4VCVCUYVEUkUrUzV2UwVBUcRkXCWIU0V7RsXAWDU6TpRhXEW6UGToRTXpWgUASrRRXaVtUQT2QqY0WkTp~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~WKX3V8VDUiV8UmUnV0V4UwVBSqQfXqWbTlT9QoXrWCU7RsQPXsW6U3RqQ8XvWJTmQgQdXUVkUHPoOlXJVbTh~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~WKX3V5VFUgV5UsUuUxV6UuV9~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~WMX3UjV2VOV3UmUbUtVcV1UpWOSeXYWLUKWISWYUVzUjVNS8YRWLUCVkSNXiW7UVUZRlYXWKUEUVS9YOWsUH~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~WOWyUmV1VHVAUiUaUyVdUnUwVJSGXrW6UUVOSJY3VhUdUXRbYKVvUHUcRuXdWFUIT8RWXvVeUXTjRZZLWoUF~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~WNWyUoUyVQV2UjUaUvVhUhV1UORyXdVjUWUmS7XlVaUeTXRKYvWMUITURbYAWIUPSBR